flowchart LR
    classDef person fill:#f7ead7,stroke:#8a5a20,color:#3e280d
    classDef external fill:#e8edf7,stroke:#3e5f93,color:#1d3154
    classDef system fill:#e8f1f2,stroke:#2f5d62,color:#163438
    classDef frontend fill:#e9f3df,stroke:#557a35,color:#2e431d
    classDef storage fill:#fff3d6,stroke:#9a6b14,color:#513807
    classDef device fill:#f3e6ec,stroke:#8b4865,color:#4b2637

    USER[用户 / 主播]:::person
    AUDIENCE[直播间观众]:::person

    subgraph ASTR[ AstrBot 运行环境 ]
        CORE[AstrBot Core<br/>事件总线 / Router / Persona Runtime / TTS]:::external
        PROVIDER[聊天模型与 TTS Provider]:::external
        AG99[AG99live Adapter Plugin<br/>Prompt / Effect / 原子段 / 协议服务]:::system
    end

    subgraph DESKTOP[ AG99live 桌面端 ]
        ELECTRON[Electron Main<br/>桌面能力 / 配置持久化]:::frontend
        RENDERER[Electron Renderer<br/>交互 UI / Session / Timeline / ModelEngine]:::frontend
        LIVE2D[Live2D Cubism WebSDK<br/>模型加载 / 每帧参数 / Physics]:::frontend
        AUDIO[浏览器媒体环境<br/>HTMLAudioElement / WebAudio]:::frontend
    end

    subgraph DATA[ 本地数据 ]
        PROFILE[Live2D 模型资源<br/>model3 / motion3 / exp3 / textures]:::storage
        SQLITE[Motion Lab SQLite<br/>原始观察事件]:::storage
        INDEXED[IndexedDB<br/>待确认 Motion Lab 事件]:::storage
        CONFIG[桌面配置与动作记录]:::storage
    end

    OBS[OBS / 直播采集]:::external
    BILI[Bilibili Live API]:::external
    ESP[ESP32 辅助显示]:::device
    REMOTE[远程执行器 / Codex App Server]:::external

    USER -->|文本 / 麦克风 / PTT| RENDERER
    USER -->|AstrBot 原生入口| CORE
    AUDIENCE -->|弹幕 / 互动| BILI
    BILI --> RENDERER

    CORE -->|调用| PROVIDER
    PROVIDER -->|回复 / 音频| CORE
    CORE -->|事件、Persona hooks、MessageChain| AG99
    AG99 -->|WebSocket v2<br/>server_info manifest<br/>live2d_scan.v2<br/>output.segment.v3| RENDERER
    RENDERER -->|input / control / profile / Motion Lab| AG99

    ELECTRON <--> RENDERER
    RENDERER --> LIVE2D
    RENDERER --> AUDIO
    AUDIO -.真实音频时钟与 RMS.-> RENDERER
    LIVE2D -->|Canvas| OBS
    RENDERER -->|窗口 / 字幕 / UI| OBS

    PROFILE --> LIVE2D
    PROFILE -.完整扫描 / semantic profile / runtime cache.-> AG99
    RENDERER -->|先写待确认事件| INDEXED
    INDEXED -.以相同 event_id 重发.-> RENDERER
    AG99 -->|异步持久化| SQLITE
    SQLITE -.persisted event_id.-> AG99
    AG99 -.recorded ACK.-> RENDERER
    RENDERER -.ACK 后删除.-> INDEXED
    ELECTRON --> CONFIG
    CONFIG --> RENDERER

    RENDERER -.状态输出.-> ESP
    AG99 -.受控任务委托.-> REMOTE
